{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":21087,\"tags\":[],\"year\":2015,\"idMal\":30276,\"staff\":[{\"id\":94091,\"name\":\"Shingo Natsume\",\"role\":\"Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94092,\"name\":\"Shouji Hata\",\"role\":\"Sound Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94093,\"name\":\"Shinichirou Ushijima\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94094,\"name\":\"Tomohiro Suzuki\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94095,\"name\":\"Yoshiaki Kawajiri\",\"role\":\"Storyboard\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94096,\"name\":\"Aki Hata\",\"role\":\"Theme Song Lyrics\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94097,\"name\":\"Hyadain\",\"role\":\"Theme Song Composition\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94098,\"name\":\"JAM Project\",\"role\":\"Theme Song Performance\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94099,\"name\":\"Makoto Miyazaki\",\"role\":\"Theme Song Arrangement\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94100,\"name\":\"Hiroko Moriguchi\",\"role\":\"Theme Song Performance\",\"image\":null}],\"title\":\"One Punch Man\",\"format\":\"TV\",\"genres\":[],\"poster\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/season/615993/posters/60a388ea6f86c.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"season\":\"\",\"status\":\"FINISHED\",\"titles\":{\"ar\":\"رجل اللكمة الواحدة\",\"bg\":\"Уанпънч-мен\",\"en\":\"One-Punch Man\",\"fr\":\"One Punch Man\",\"he\":\"איש האגרוף הבודד\",\"it\":\"One Punch Man\",\"ja\":\"ONE PUNCH MAN ワンパンマン\",\"ko\":\"원펀맨\",\"pl\":\"One Punch Man\",\"ru\":\"Ванпанчмен\",\"tr\":\"Tek Vuruş Adam\",\"uk\":\"Ванпанчмен\",\"x-jat\":\"1PM\",\"zh-Hans\":\"一拳超人\",\"zh-Hant\":\"一拳超人\"},\"studios\":[],\"trailer\":{\"id\":\"tMblzsXwAKo\",\"site\":\"YouTube\"},\"backdrop\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/graphical/293088-g2.jpg\",\"duration\":24,\"episodes\":12,\"overview\":\"The seemingly ordinary and unimpressive Saitama has a rather unique hobby: being a hero. In order to pursue his childhood dream, he trained relentlessly for three years—and lost all of his hair in the process. Now, Saitama is incredibly powerful, so much so that no enemy is able to defeat him in battle. In fact, all it takes to defeat evildoers with just one punch has led to an unexpected problem—he is no longer able to enjoy the thrill of battling and has become quite bored.\\n\\nThis all changes with the arrival of Genos, a 19-year-old cyborg, who wishes to be Saitama's disciple after seeing what he is capable of. Genos proposes that the two join the Hero Association in order to become certified heroes that will be recognized for their positive contributions to society, and Saitama, shocked that no one knows who he is, quickly agrees. And thus begins the story of One Punch Man, an action-comedy that follows an eccentric individual who longs to fight strong enemies that can hopefully give him the excitement he once felt and just maybe, he'll become popular in the process.\\n\\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"tMblzsXwAKo\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Saitama\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/57048/image/tiny-43bd71cdfc07f3836075a3c83adf8c4f.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Makoto Furukawa\"},{\"name\":\"Genos\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/57047/image/tiny-a5dbd7a48c847819ef0cb6ab5c1432b6.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Kaito Ishikawa\"},{\"name\":\"Smile Man\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/83414/image/tiny-f5227bda9e93307619e685c5afcd2add.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"All Back-Man\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/57049/image/tiny-2f7e7c03bdf9e40ae2224f007fcb7b86.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Hiromichi Tezuka\"},{\"name\":\"Amai Mask\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/57073/image/tiny-9ff05a1f68803b800bfee353086d164c.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Mamoru Miyano\"},{\"name\":\"Armored Gorilla\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/57075/image/tiny-5